@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #8A8F98
skinparam ArrowColor #8A8F98
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
title Maestro Core release plan: data safe and measured first
start
#E7F0FB:**0.25 Your data, safe**
data/ folder outside the program, backup before every update and migration,
Restore button, songs saved as files, simulated-update test;
-> Gate: Simulated update loses nothing?;
:**0.26 Measure**
persistent execution ledger, real tokens per answer;
-> Gate: Baseline of the latest release measured?;
:**0.27 Understanding + exact commands**
parser, RAG/FTS5, single intent contract, Haiku only as fallback;
-> Gate: Exact commands use 0 Claude calls?;
:**0.28 Local model as the understanding layer**
bundled with the app, one on/off button, Mac Metal first;
-> Gate: Matches Haiku on the corpus without audio dropouts?;
:**0.29 Hybrid capabilities**
bass, rhythm, harmony: the model only fills the gaps;
-> Gate: Fewer tokens per accepted result, blind A/B?;
:**0.30 Learning Lab**
evidence-backed candidates, one-click labelling;
-> Gate: Nothing activates without approval?;
:**0.31 Private GitHub data repo**
memory, executions, learning, prompts; private check;
-> Gate: Restore everything on another computer;
stop
@enduml
